{"id":"ed1d89172a263c0a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSat.md","title":"SSat","display":"SSat","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SSat","parameters":["F","R","f","r","D","I","J","K","e","G","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SSat"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span><span>K</span><span>e</span><span>G</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>、<code>K</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>G</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SSat F R f r D I J K e G a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists S\n  (and\n    (@ STable F R f r D I J K S)\n    (exists z1469 (and (exists z1470 (and (@ Pair e G z1470) (@ Pair a z1470 z1469))) (in z1469 S)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84b5c74b13d9fb18\" href=\"?note=84b5c74b13d9fb18\" title=\"ZFC_STable\">STable</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SSat F R f r D I J K e G a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STable|STable]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STable","status":"resolved","id":"84b5c74b13d9fb18","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STable|STable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":974,"backlinks":[{"id":"734a8eb1634c15b3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSat|SSat]]"},{"id":"ef58afc7cc9bf1fb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_DistinctSeq|DistinctSeq]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_SAssignTuple|SAssignTuple]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]；[[ZFC_SSemRow|SSemRow]]；[[ZFC_SeqTo|SeqTo]]"},{"id":"fdaac29642e66fd6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SCompClosed|SCompClosed]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]"},{"id":"29fca5c0e2809eac","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]；[[ZFC_SFm|SFm]]；[[ZFC_SForms|SForms]]；[[ZFC_SFull|SFull]]；[[ZFC_SModel|SModel]]；[[ZFC_SSat|SSat]]"},{"id":"3c4fd3dee2f60a10","anchor":"ref-6","locat